From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: harden WED ring start unwind and SER terminal
 failure latching

Check warp_ring_init return in wed_start(), avoid infinite polling on stop_pdma0 abort, and latch SER terminal failure while retaining allocated DMA resources.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
